    {
      "id": 401,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Golden-path duration (p95 / p99)",
      "description": "The whole login->create->submit->wait->approve flow, one point per k6 run (scripts/perf/k6-golden-path.js). No $environment filter -- k6 only ever targets Stage. Flatlines between runs since k6 only pushes metrics while running, not continuously; that's expected -- compare this run's line against the previous run's, don't read the flat gap as a live signal.",
